    <string name="s_howto">How to add your own themes</string>
    <string name="howto_title">Your own themes</string>
    <string name="howto_text">A theme is a folder in Osmon/themes on the TV storage.\n\n• A folder with one picture or video = a theme with that wallpaper.\n• A folder with several pictures = a slideshow theme.\n• A theme.json file in the folder sets the name, colors and dimming.\n\nFrom a computer:\nadb push FOLDER /sdcard/Osmon/themes/\n\nPut single wallpapers in /sdcard/Osmon/wallpapers, then pick them under “Wallpaper”.\n\nUse 1080p videos — 4K will slow the menu down.</string>
