    <string name="s_about">About</string>
    <string name="about_text">A free launcher for Android TV.\n\nRemote: OK opens an app; long OK or Menu on an icon — favorites, order, hide.\n\nAerial videos are streamed from Apple\'s public servers. Osmon is not affiliated with Apple.</string>
